      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "A successful injection has nothing to take",
      "items": [
        "Keys resolve at the edge and never enter the context package",
        "The job that writes cannot reach a model; the job with the model cannot write"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Text selects nothing",
